## Dependencies and crate policy

- **NEVER** add external crates without explicit approval.
- **NEVER** use `unsafe` outside of `src/vm/` and `src/utils/arena.rs`. These are the only permitted locations; every `unsafe` block requires a `// SAFETY:` comment explaining the invariant.
- Prefer `#![forbid(unsafe_code)]` on all modules except `vm/` and `utils/arena.rs`.
- Any `unsafe` code must be wrapped in a safe abstraction immediately. No raw pointer arithmetic leaking into safe modules.
- Prefer `std` modules: `std::io`, `std::collections`, `std::sync`, `std::thread`.
- Edition is **2024** (see `Cargo.toml`).

