## CI pipeline

| Step | Command |
|------|---------|
| Format | `cargo fmt --check` |
| Build | `cargo build` |
| Lint | `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` |
| Test | `cargo test` |
| Docs | `cargo doc --no-deps` |
| Integration | `cargo test --test integration` (when integration test harness exists) |

Clippy groups enabled in `Cargo.toml`: `pedantic`, `perf`, `missing_errors_doc`. Also enforced: `unwrap_used = deny`, `expect_used = deny`, `dbg_macro = deny`, `print_stdout = deny`, `print_stderr = deny`. Address or allow with justification.

