- [ ] `cargo test` passes
- [ ] `cargo build` — no warnings
- [ ] `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` passes
- [ ] `cargo fmt --check` passes
- [ ] All public items have doc comments
- [ ] No `_` wildcards on AST, token, or opcode enums
- [ ] No `.unwrap()` or `.expect()` in passes that process user input
- [ ] Every `unsafe` block has a `// SAFETY:` comment
- [ ] No commented-out code or debug prints
- [ ] Span information preserved through the full pipeline
- [ ] Language semantics match design docs — not invented in code

